{"user": "why does white not have a legal move", "user_ts": "2026-08-20T02:53:04.827121+00:00", "assistant": "Because a White move is only legal if it would **trap at least one Black disc between the new White disc and another White disc** in a straight line.\n\nAfter Black plays **a3**, the empty squares are **a1, g2, h1**:\n\n- **a1**: next to White discs, but no Black disc gets trapped.\n- **g2**: any Black discs nearby don\u2019t end in a White disc.\n- **h1**: down the h-file is Black discs, but there\u2019s no White disc at the far end to bracket them.\n\nSo White has **zero legal moves** and must **pass**; then Black moves again.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-20T02:53:15.001894+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-20T02:53:16.957634+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "consensus": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "votes": {"Knowledge Deficit Question": 3}, "confidence": {"Knowledge Deficit Question": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "llama": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "sonnet": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "votes": {"Board Report": 3, "Local Justification": 3, "General Principle": 3}, "confidence": {"Board Report": 1.0, "Local Justification": 1.0, "General Principle": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "llama": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "sonnet": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false, "coarse": ["Direct Instruction"]}}
